flowchart TD
    C[Client] -->|POST /transactions<br>POST /login-attempts| ALB[Application Load Balancer]
    ALB --> API[ECS Fargate<br>FastAPI]
    API <-->|history| H[(DynamoDB<br>Transactions + LoginAttempts)]
    API -->|flagged only| Q[SQS queue]
    Q --> L[Lambda<br>FraudProcessor]
    Q -.->|after 3 failed tries| D[SQS dead-letter queue]
    L --> F[(DynamoDB<br>FlaggedTransactions)]
    L --> S[SNS topic]
    S -->|email| U[Customer email]
    Q -.->|message count| A[CloudWatch alarm]
    A --> S
